        <mxCell id="notes" value="External: sys_clk, rst_n_in, uart_rx → SoC; uart_tx, led_ready/busy/error ← SoC.&lt;br&gt;CLOCK distributes clk/rst_n to all five blocks (shared nets omitted for clarity).&lt;br&gt;SRAM clients: 0=NVDLA read, 1=NVDLA write, 2=Vicuna data, 3..10 inactive.&lt;br&gt;This regression preloads SRAM; UART remains idle." vertex="1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#111111;strokeColor=#555555;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=18;">
